Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:44.04,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:44.04,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}法里亚 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-4 6-4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 谢尔顿 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:04.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Jaime, huge congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:04.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,海梅 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,We saw you sitting on the chair at the end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们看到你坐在椅子上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:07.82,EN,,0,0,0,,of the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:07.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,坐了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:08.78,EN,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:08.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,那会儿你在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:09.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Who were you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:09.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,你想到的是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:11.18,EN,,0,0,0,,What did it mean to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:11.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场胜利对你意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:13.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about those guys on the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:13.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想的是包厢里那几个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.80,0:00:15.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Just very emotional moment for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.80,0:00:15.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说是很动感情的一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:16.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and for my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我的团队也是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,It's like we made it moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种感觉是 我们做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:19.96,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, just to do it here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:19.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且就是在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.76,EN,,0,0,0,,in front of an amazing crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,台下这么棒的观众
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:24.82,EN,,0,0,0,,against the home player at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:24.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手还是主场球员 又是夜场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:26.70,EN,,0,0,0,,This amazing venue just makes it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:26.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,这么好的球场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:28.60,EN,,0,0,0,,a little more special.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:28.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,让这一切更特别了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.60,0:00:28.84,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.60,0:00:28.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm just enjoying my first top ten win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我第一次赢下世界前十
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:32.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So those moments,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:32.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:35.22,EN,,0,0,0,,you've got to take it all in and just enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:35.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,你得把它全部收下 好好享受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:36.92,EN,,0,0,0,,You've been on the rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:36.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,你这阵子一直在往上走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:38.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Were you expecting something like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:38.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样的一场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.42,0:00:40.50,EN,,0,0,0,,this to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.42,0:00:40.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,你预料到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:41.54,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:41.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,我说不好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:43.14,EN,,0,0,0,,I worked for these moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:43.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直在为这样的时刻努力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:43.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:43.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:49.90,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I started the year not so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:49.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也说不好 今年开局并不好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:54.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Trying to just get in the top 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:54.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,当时只想着先进世界前一百
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.04,0:00:55.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.04,0:00:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,真说不好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:57.80,EN,,0,0,0,,What's changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.36,0:00:57.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是什么变了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:00.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Beat my mentality.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:00.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的心态吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.44,0:01:02.10,EN,,0,0,0,,Work ethic maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.44,0:01:02.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有训练的态度
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Just trying to focus more on the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,更专注在过程上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Not too much when these moments
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,不去想这些时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.18,0:01:07.48,EN,,0,0,0,,are going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.18,0:01:07.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,什么时候会到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:08.40,EN,,0,0,0,,It will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:08.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,它会到的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:09.98,EN,,0,0,0,,It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:09.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,它就是会到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:11.64,EN,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm so happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:11.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我才这么高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.64,0:01:14.68,EN,,0,0,0,,because I'm focusing on the process,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.64,0:01:14.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我专注的是过程
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:16.42,EN,,0,0,0,,not taking steps ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:16.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有想着一步登天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:18.38,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, in these moments you've got
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:18.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这样的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.38,0:01:18.94,EN,,0,0,0,,to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.38,0:01:18.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,就该好好庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.94,0:01:20.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Because mentally you were tested
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.94,0:01:20.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天你的心理被反复考验
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.04,0:01:21.10,EN,,0,0,0,,so many times today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.04,0:01:21.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,考验了很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:22.22,EN,,0,0,0,,You came back at you hard at the end
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:22.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一盘末段他追得很凶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:23.60,EN,,0,0,0,,of the first set and you were a breakdown
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:23.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二盘你还被破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:25.02,EN,,0,0,0,,in the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:25.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,落后了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.02,0:01:25.90,EN,,0,0,0,,You thought clearly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.02,0:01:25.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,那些时刻你的头脑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:27.24,EN,,0,0,0,,in those moments today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:27.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.24,0:01:30.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure. I was 4 -1 down on this set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.24,0:01:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实 这一盘我一比四落后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:32.06,EN,,0,0,0,,I made five games in a row
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:32.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后连赢五局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.06,0:01:34.22,EN,,0,0,0,,against Ben Shelton in this center court.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.06,0:01:34.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手是谢尔顿 还是在中央球场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.22,0:01:36.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Not easy, so I'm just really focused
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.22,0:01:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,不容易 所以我就是很专注
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:39.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and with really a routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,老老实实按流程来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:41.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, wish you luck for the next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:41.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你下一轮好运
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.94,0:01:42.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.94,0:01:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:44.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:44.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
